# File Length Limit

Keep source files under **350 lines**.

When a file grows near or above the limit:

- Extract cohesive pieces into new files.
- Prefer small focused modules/components.
- Avoid adding more logic to oversized files unless unavoidable.

If a requested change must touch an oversized file, complete the request and add a `*.todo.md` note with a suggested split plan.

